{
  "id": "457",
  "title": "What's in this Folder?",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-02-04",
  "synopsis": "Little He is at the office looking for a report.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/640/1281f8869630ae8d7dc38550e173ab1cf68c8bad.mp3?1698351801",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "这个文件夹里是什么？\n\n小何：这个文件夹里是什么？\n小张：是公司的工作报告。你在找什么？\n小何：我在找上个月的工作报告。\n小张：应该在这个文件夹里。找到了。在这儿，给你。\n小何：谢谢你。\n小张：奇怪，订书机呢？我记得我刚才放这儿的呀。\n小何：在你后面的桌子上呢。",
    "traditional": "這個文件夾裡是什麼？\n\n小何：這個文件夾裡是什麼？\n小張：是公司的工作報告。你在找什麼？\n小何：我在找上個月的工作報告。\n小張：應該在這個文件夾裡。找到了。在這兒，給你。\n小何：謝謝你。\n小張：奇怪，訂書機呢？我記得我剛才放這兒的呀。\n小何：在你後面的桌子上呢。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What's in this Folder?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小何：这个文件夹里是什么？",
      "traditional": "小何：這個文件夾裡是什麼？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé zhè ge wén jiàn jiā lǐ shì shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: What's in this folder?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小张：是公司的工作报告。你在找什么？",
      "traditional": "小張：是公司的工作報告。你在找什麼？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng shì gōng sī de gōng zuò bào gào nǐ zài zhǎo shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: It's the company's work reports. What are you looking for?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小何：我在找上个月的工作报告。",
      "traditional": "小何：我在找上個月的工作報告。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé wǒ zài zhǎo shàng ge yuè de gōng zuò bào gào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: I'm looking for last month's work report."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小张：应该在这个文件夹里。找到了。在这儿，给你。",
      "traditional": "小張：應該在這個文件夾裡。找到了。在這兒，給你。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng yīng gāi zài zhè ge wén jiàn jiā lǐ zhǎo dào le zài zhè‘r gěi nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: It should be in this folder. Found it. Here you are."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小何：谢谢你。",
      "traditional": "小何：謝謝你。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé xiè xie nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小张：奇怪，订书机呢？我记得我刚才放这儿的呀。",
      "traditional": "小張：奇怪，訂書機呢？我記得我剛才放這兒的呀。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng qí guài dìng shū jī ne wǒ jì de wǒ gāng cái fàng zhè‘r de ya",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Hang: Strange, where is the stapler? I remember putting it here just now."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小何：在你后面的桌子上呢。",
      "traditional": "小何：在你後面的桌子上呢。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé zài nǐ hòu miàn de zhuō zi shang ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: It's on the table behind you."
    }
  ],
